# Force git to treat F#/C#/F# script source as text. literal control chars (RLO/NUL/ZWJ 등)
# 이 들어간 source 도 binary 로 fall-through 하지 않게 하여 diff/blame/merge 가시성 보존.
# eol=lf — CLAUDE.md 강제 규약 (C#/F# 는 LF only). core.autocrlf=true 환경에서도
# checkout 시 CRLF 변환 차단. 다음 git checkout/operation 부터 기존 .cs/.fs 도 LF 로 정규화.
*.fs    text diff eol=lf
*.fsi   text diff eol=lf
*.fsx   text diff eol=lf
*.cs    text diff eol=lf

# Windows batch scripts must keep CRLF. cmd.exe misparses LF-only .bat/.cmd
# (set/() blocks, ^ escaping, labels break) — overrides core.autocrlf=input.
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf

# Linux deployment scripts and systemd units must remain executable/parsible after
# checkout on Windows development machines.
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
